What are you talking about?
Are you feeling all right, Makihara?

00:14:10.683 --> 00:14:13.102
What would we be praying to anyway?

00:14:13.311 --> 00:14:18.608
We'll be praying to Psycho Helmet-sama,
who embodies the Divine Tree.

00:14:18.816 --> 00:14:20.068
All in favor, say aye.

00:14:20.276 --> 00:14:21.235
Hey, Makihara--

00:14:21.444 --> 00:14:22.236
Aye.

00:14:22.445 --> 00:14:23.404
Aye.

00:14:23.613 --> 00:14:24.906
Aye.

00:14:25.114 --> 00:14:27.784
Wait! This is insane.

00:14:27.992 --> 00:14:29.786
--Quit fooling--
--Now, now.

00:14:29.994 --> 00:14:33.039
No reason to decline so hastily.

00:14:33.247 --> 00:14:35.833
It is always difficult
to accept new opinions.

00:14:36.042 --> 00:14:37.502
Kamuro?!

00:14:39.629 --> 00:14:42.382
Nii-san, have you heard of
the Psycho Helmet Religion?

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.842
Huh? Are you interested in it, too, Ritsu?

00:14:45.051 --> 00:14:49.263
No way. But there are a lot of believers
at our school, apparently...

00:14:49.472 --> 00:14:52.517
And the rate at which
it's spreading is bizarre.

00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:55.728
And their object of worship, or whatever...

00:14:55.937 --> 00:14:57.980
...is that Divine Tree, apparently.

00:14:58.189 --> 00:15:04.987
Hm... Meaning if we destroy the broccoli,
we'll be making enemies of those people.

00:15:05.196 --> 00:15:09.409
But everything I've looked up about them
suggests they're pretty harmless.

00:15:09.617 --> 00:15:12.078
They sell merch and hold discussions.

00:15:12.286 --> 00:15:14.997
It seems more like a fan club
rather than a religion.

00:15:15.206 --> 00:15:19.836
It's like a gathering where they all obsess
over something unusual, pretty much.

00:15:20.044 --> 00:15:22.797
And you'd usually call that strange.

00:15:23.005 --> 00:15:25.591
Of course, we should be on our guard.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:29.470
They might even try
to get in our way. Hm...

00:15:29.679 --> 00:15:32.974
Let's just go with pulling it out quickly
and get the hell out of Dodge.

00:15:33.182 --> 00:15:35.268
My head hurts!

00:15:35.476 --> 00:15:37.061
I'll have some sugar.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.981
Ritsu, you took some candy to school?

00:15:40.189 --> 00:15:44.527
Oh, this? I got it from the student
council president earlier.

00:15:44.735 --> 00:15:48.156
Kageyama-kun, before you go home, here.

00:15:48.364 --> 00:15:49.198
What are these?

00:15:49.407 --> 00:15:52.827
Apparently, it's a candy being made
to lure tourists to the city.

00:15:53.035 --> 00:15:58.207
But my father got a bunch of samples
at the prefectural assembly.

00:15:58.416 --> 00:15:59.333
Sure, thanks.

00:15:59.542 --> 00:16:01.711
You're a lifesaver.

00:16:01.919 --> 00:16:03.754
Have one, Nii-san.

00:16:03.963 --> 00:16:04.964
Thanks.

00:16:05.173 --> 00:16:06.466
You, too, Reigen-san.

00:16:06.674 --> 00:16:09.760
Oh? Er, I'll take one for later.

00:16:09.969 --> 00:16:11.888
I'll have mine later, too.

00:16:12.096 --> 00:16:14.140
After I pull out that broccoli.

00:16:15.349 --> 00:16:18.269
Could we make a pit stop on our way there?

00:16:21.606 --> 00:16:23.524
He sure is walking fast.

00:16:23.733 --> 00:16:26.110
Where are you going, Ritsu?

00:16:27.278 --> 00:16:28.613
Ritsu?

00:16:28.613 --> 00:16:28.821
"Seasoning City Civic Center"
Ritsu?

00:16:28.821 --> 00:16:30.031
"Seasoning City Civic Center"

00:16:30.031 --> 00:16:33.075
"Seasoning City Civic Center" In here. There
are some people I want to introduce you to.

00:16:33.075 --> 00:16:33.117
In here. There are some people
I want to introduce you to.

00:16:33.326 --> 00:16:35.453
This is the civic center.

00:16:42.168 --> 00:16:44.754
Ritsu, who are these people?

00:16:44.962 --> 00:16:47.048
They're members of the
Psycho Helmet Religion.

00:16:47.256 --> 00:16:48.132
Huh?

00:16:48.341 --> 00:16:50.760
Nii-san, let's rethink this.

00:16:50.968 --> 00:16:52.178
R-Rethink what...?

00:16:52.386 --> 00:16:54.305
You can't play dumb with us.

00:16:54.514 --> 00:16:57.141
You're trying to destroy the Divine Tree?

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:00.978
The Divine Tree brings peace
to everyone's hearts.

00:17:01.187 --> 00:17:03.481
We need the Divine Tree in our city.

00:17:03.689 --> 00:17:04.732
Hang on a sec...

00:17:04.941 --> 00:17:07.360
When did you start leaking
information to these guys?

00:17:07.568 --> 00:17:09.362
Ritsu, what's wrong?

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:13.324
I just suddenly realized that I need
to protect the Divine Tree.

00:17:13.533 --> 00:17:17.245
And then I just had a feeling
that everyone would gather here.

00:17:17.453 --> 00:17:21.916
What are you planning to do,
bringing us here?

00:17:22.124 --> 00:17:24.252
That candy!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:27.630
Have a seat, Nii-san. You, too, Reigen-san.

00:17:27.838 --> 00:17:30.258
Here you go. Have some tea, too.

00:17:30.466 --> 00:17:32.426
No need to be so guarded.

00:17:32.635 --> 00:17:34.679
Let's talk this over peacefully.

00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:36.347
How about it?

00:17:48.776 --> 00:17:51.737
I guess they're not even willing to listen.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.909
I don't think we needed to run that fast...

00:17:57.118 --> 00:17:58.160
If we stayed there,

00:17:58.369 --> 00:18:01.998
we would've fell under some group
hypnosis and ended up believers.

00:18:02.206 --> 00:18:04.333
Take out your candy, right now!

00:18:04.542 --> 00:18:06.085
My candy?

00:18:06.294 --> 00:18:08.504
That place had a bunch of these.

00:18:08.713 --> 00:18:11.340
This might be how Ritsu got brainwashed.

00:18:11.549 --> 00:18:14.218
Ritsu got brainwashed?

00:18:14.427 --> 00:18:17.179
I can't leave him like that.

00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:19.223
Calm down!

00:18:19.432 --> 00:18:22.518
He doesn't seem to be in any real danger yet,
so we need to carefully look into--

00:18:22.727 --> 00:18:24.937
Hey, there...

00:18:25.146 --> 00:18:31.902
Resistance is futile.
Psycho Helmet-sama sees all.

00:18:33.988 --> 00:18:36.991
Mob, I think you're right.

00:18:37.199 --> 00:18:39.535
We're definitely being watched.

00:18:39.744 --> 00:18:42.747
Huh? What the hell is that shirt?
Why did you take off your jacket?

00:18:42.955 --> 00:18:46.250
I got hot after we ran.

00:18:46.459 --> 00:18:50.212
Keep it on. Your school jacket
has higher defense points.

00:18:51.839 --> 00:18:54.175
Trying to do something
about the Divine Tree?

00:18:54.383 --> 00:18:56.344
But that's impossible.

00:18:56.552 --> 00:18:58.304
Reigen Arataka.

00:18:58.512 --> 00:18:59.764
--Gah!
--I heard that you were plotting to cut down the Divine Tree!

00:18:59.764 --> 00:19:02.391
--I heard that you were plotting
to cut down the Divine Tree!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.560
