of being brainwashed when you're not.

00:21:41.509 --> 00:21:45.262
The hearts of the citizens are
far more important than the city.

00:21:45.471 --> 00:21:49.016
Most of the people in the city are
believers of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

00:21:49.225 --> 00:21:51.644
We should just respect that.

00:21:54.021 --> 00:21:56.816
From now on, this city--this world--

00:21:57.024 --> 00:22:00.861
Is going to live in harmony with the Divine Tree
and the Psycho Helmet Religion...

